{"id":"n75939-1-9","stage":4,"title":"조짐 · 预兆","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75939-1-9-1","ko":"가게 문을 열자마자 대량 주문이 들어왔어요.","zh":"店铺一开门就收到了大批订单。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}},{"text":"문을","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문을","audio":"/audio/e9d89a0e3afa5573f056.mp3"}},{"text":"열자마자","meaning":"开张，开门","explanation":"열다：开张，开门；자마자：表示前一动作发生后立刻发生后一动作：“一……就……”。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"3","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열자마자","audio":"/audio/db439ff830dff96607f0.mp3"}},{"text":"대량","meaning":"大量，批量","explanation":"대량：大量，批量。","readings":[{"term":"대량","audio":"/audio/48a0b573abbb9dc0c941.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14336","senseId":"1","lemma":"대량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대량","audio":"/audio/48a0b573abbb9dc0c941.mp3"}},{"text":"주문이","meaning":"订购，订货","explanation":"주문：订购，订货；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주문","audio":"/audio/d64a64f06a81e5482e98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25943","senseId":"1","lemma":"주문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주문이","audio":"/audio/1ce9d05245583ac818b5.mp3"}},{"text":"들어왔어요.","meaning":"进账","explanation":"들어오다：进账；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"2","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어왔어요","audio":"/audio/6479d4d513ccb29dcfa1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"开张，开门","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"开始一天的营业。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]},{"id":"48a0b573abbb9dc0","term":"대량","zh":"大量，批量","audio":"/audio/48a0b573abbb9dc0c941.mp3","entryId":"14336","definition":"非常多的量。","pronunciation":["대ː량"]},{"id":"d64a64f06a81e548","term":"주문","zh":"订购，订货","audio":"/audio/d64a64f06a81e5482e98.mp3","entryId":"25943","definition":"向相关制造商或销售商告知自己所需要的物品的种类、数量、模样、规格等，并叮嘱对方按要求制造或送货的事宜或指其内容。","pronunciation":["주ː문"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进账","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"产生收入等。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/30e25f3938c9cf6f00a7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75939-1-9-2","ko":"오늘 장사는 출발부터 조짐이 좋군요.","zh":"看来今天的生意从一开始就势头很好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"장사는","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장사는","audio":"/audio/381260372d1b425d00d5.mp3"}},{"text":"출발부터","meaning":"出发，起步","explanation":"출발：出发，起步；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"출발","audio":"/audio/c92d127244fd943f6a04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72140","senseId":"2","lemma":"출발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출발부터","audio":"/audio/ce6244da26d229ac567e.mp3"}},{"text":"조짐이","meaning":"预兆，兆头，迹象，征兆，征候","explanation":"조짐：预兆，兆头，迹象，征兆，征候；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"조짐","audio":"/audio/8664e725fe2bd9e371c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75939","senseId":"1","lemma":"조짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조짐이","audio":"/audio/efabab8fe4d98d781924.mp3"}},{"text":"좋군요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋군요","audio":"/audio/7a9740c0436aaee72cec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"c92d127244fd943f","term":"출발","zh":"出发，起步","audio":"/audio/c92d127244fd943f6a04.mp3","entryId":"72140","definition":"开始做某件事情；或指那样的开始。","pronunciation":["출발"]},{"id":"8664e725fe2bd9e3","term":"조짐","zh":"预兆，兆头，迹象，征兆，征候","audio":"/audio/8664e725fe2bd9e371c8.mp3","entryId":"75939","definition":"好事或坏事等，事先出现的迹象。","pronunciation":["조짐"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/50b0cea3522123356d05.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.629,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75939","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://crea